&lt;h3&gt;About Flipdish&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flipdish, we’re turning the tables in favour of independent restaurant and takeaway owners by offering them powerful, simple-to-use tech solutions backed by real human support. Everything we do is designed to make running a restaurant satisfyingly simple in a world that’s anything but.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join our Customer Support team in our Karachi hub, helping restaurant and takeaway owners get the most from Flipdish’s products and services. You’ll be a key point of contact for customers across phone, email, and chat, resolving issues quickly, clearly, and professionally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role looks like customers feeling supported, issues being resolved within agreed service levels, accurate records being maintained in Salesforce, and clear communication that helps customers keep their businesses running smoothly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note this role is working on a 7 day a week shift rota, covering 6am - 12am (UTC) shifts.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll own&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide outstanding customer support across phone, email, and chat; respond promptly and professionally to customer questions, issues, and requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve customer complaints with empathy and ownership; listen carefully, understand the issue, and work towards a timely and satisfactory resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clear instructions, updates, and solutions; adapt your style to suit different customer needs while keeping every interaction friendly and professional.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate customer records in Salesforce; document interactions, issues, resolutions, and follow-ups clearly so the wider team has the context they need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Support colleagues and other departments; escalate complex issues appropriately, share knowledge, and contribute to better ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong product knowledge across Flipdish software and services; stay up to date on new features, updates, and customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet agreed service levels and quality standards; work towards response time, resolution time, customer satisfaction, and quality assurance targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create positive customer experiences; build trust with customers through helpful, calm, and professional interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What success looks like&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customers receive clear, helpful, and timely support across all channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer issues are resolved professionally, with appropriate follow-up and accurate Salesforce documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Service level agreements and quality targets are consistently met or exceeded.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complex issues are escalated with the right context, helping teams resolve problems faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customers feel listened to, respected, and confident using Flipdish products and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll thrive in this role if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have previous experience in customer support, customer service, or a similar customer-facing role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are fluent in English, with excellent verbal and written communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable supporting customers across phone, email, and chat.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can assess customer issues, think critically, and find practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Show empathy and patience, especially when customers are frustrated or under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are organised and detail-oriented, with the ability to prioritise tasks and manage multiple customer queries at once.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable working with customer support tools, software systems, and computer applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are willing and flexible to work evening shifts and weekends when needed to support customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of your work and follow through until issues are properly resolved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The following would help you stand out:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Salesforce or a similar CRM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a SaaS, restaurant technology, food delivery, or hospitality environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SLAs, customer satisfaction metrics, and quality assurance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you get&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a growing startup and we understand that amazing incentives will attract amazing talent. Alongside a competitive salary, we offer unparalleled opportunities for career growth. If you’re smart, ambitious, and hard-working, we’ll do whatever it takes to make you a Flipdisher!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time off:&lt;/strong&gt; 24 days annual leave &lt;strong&gt;+ public holidays +&lt;/strong&gt; company days (e.g. &lt;strong&gt;Summer Fridays&lt;/strong&gt;, seasonal)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private healthcare:&lt;/strong&gt; OPD + IPD coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transport:&lt;/strong&gt; Company-provided pick-and-drop service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team connection:&lt;/strong&gt; Quarterly team meet-ups and company events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Interview process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here’s what you can expect throughout the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiter screening call (15 minutes)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring manager interview (45–60 minutes)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competency / role-specific stage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reference checks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Culture&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flipdish, we’re on the side of independent restaurant and takeaway owners, running busy operations on tight margins with rising costs, staffing challenges, and an increasingly demanding customer base. Our job is to make their lives easier with technology that’s powerful, satisfyingly simple, and backed by real human support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our integrated ecosystem, spanning online ordering, marketing, loyalty, point of sale, menu optimisation, and operational automation, helps restaurants grow while staying in control. We’re an AI-first company, and we use it to help our customers get better outcomes, faster ordering, smarter marketing, and smoother operations, so owners and teams can spend more time on what matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inside the company, we value ownership and clarity, with a friendly, people-led culture behind it. We trust our people to help shape what kind of employer Flipdish is, not just follow a script. Transparency is huge for us: we listen to each other, collaborate, and create the space for people to grow (with balance, not burnout). We care about diversity, inclusion, and wellbeing as standard, and we encourage flexibility where it works. We’re focused on impact and team energy, not “being seen”. You’ll have meaningful scope, work closely with smart people across teams, and be trusted to make things better as Flipdish scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’d like to read more about interviewing at Flipdish, please check out &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.flipdish.com/downloads/Flipdish-Interview-Guide-2026.pdf&quot;&gt;our Interviewing at Flipdish guide.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Please note: Please attach your CV below. If you experience an issue with uploading your CV, please continue with the application without uploading and forward a copy of your CV to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:saleh.shah@flipdish.com&quot;&gt;saleh.shah@flipdish.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;At Flipdish, we’re turning the tables in favour of independent restaurant and takeaway owners by offering them powerful, simple-to-use tech solutions backed by real human support. Everything we do is designed to make running a restaurant satisfyingly simple in a world that’s anything but.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;You’ll join the Field Sales team working across the assigned Ireland territory, supporting Flipdish’s mission to make running a restaurant satisfyingly simple. You’ll partner closely with Field Sales Account Executives, Sales Leadership, and Marketing to generate qualified opportunities, build pipeline, and create strong handoffs that support long-term customer growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;Success in this role looks like building a healthy pipeline of qualified meetings, consistently converting outreach into booked opportunities, and being a trusted first point of contact for prospective customers in your territory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;What you’ll own&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect restaurants and takeaway businesses within your assigned territory to build a strong pipeline of qualified opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use a mix of field visits, phone calls, email, and social outreach to engage prospects and create interest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify inbound and outbound leads and book meetings or product demonstrations for Field Sales Account Executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage territory coverage by planning visits to target accounts and attending relevant local networking events, trade shows, and business gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate CRM records, tracking outreach, lead quality, meeting activity, and conversion performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Field Sales Account Executives to improve outreach strategy, messaging, and handoff quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge poor decisions and propose better ways of working. Constructive challenge is a responsibility — prioritising harmony over truth or progress is a failure of responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;What success looks like&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A steady flow of qualified meetings and opportunities created from your outreach and territory activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong conversion from prospecting activity to booked meetings and sales handoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality CRM hygiene and reliable reporting on pipeline and activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective collaboration with Account Executives that improves follow-up, conversion, and customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increased territory penetration through consistent, disciplined field execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;About you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;You’ll thrive in this role if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong interpersonal and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can work independently, manage time well, and stay organised across a busy territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable prospecting through phone, email, social outreach, and in-person meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring resilience, energy, and a growth mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are confident handling rejection and staying motivated in a fast-paced sales environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are familiar with CRM systems and sales tools such as Salesforce, HubSpot, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;The following would help you stand out:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entry-level sales experience, or equivalent practical experience in a customer-facing role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the restaurant, hospitality, or hospitality-tech sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the sales process and engaging decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel within your assigned territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;What you get&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;We’re a growing startup and we understand that amazing incentives will attract amazing talent. Alongside a competitive salary, we offer unparalleled opportunities for career growth. If you’re smart, ambitious, and hard-working, we’ll do whatever it takes to make you a Flipdisher!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hub model (hybrid): a healthy blend of hub + home working, with time in our Sandyford office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off: 25 days annual leave + public holidays + company days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private healthcare: IE cover provided through Laya Healthcare&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension: retirement savings support in Ireland&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team connection: regular team meet-ups and company events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;Interview process&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;Here’s what you can expect throughout the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter screening call (15 minutes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hiring manager interview (45 - 60 minutes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hiring manager interview (45 - 60 minutes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competency / technical stage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reference checks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;Our Culture&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;At Flipdish, we’re on the side of independent restaurant and takeaway owners, running busy operations on tight margins with rising costs, staffing challenges, and an increasingly demanding customer base. Our job is to make their lives easier with technology that’s powerful, satisfyingly simple, and backed by real human support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;Our integrated ecosystem, spanning online ordering, marketing, loyalty, point of sale, menu optimisation, and operational automation, helps restaurants grow while staying in control. We’re an AI-first company, and we use it to help our customers get better outcomes, faster ordering, smarter marketing, and smoother operations, so owners and teams can spend more time on what matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;Inside the company, we value ownership and clarity, with a friendly, people-led culture behind it. We trust our people to help shape what kind of employer Flipdish is, not just follow a script. Transparency is huge for us: we listen to each other, and create the space for people to grow, with balance not burnout. We’re focused on impact and team energy, not “being seen”. You’ll have meaningful scope, work closely with smart people across teams, and be trusted to make things better as Flipdish scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;If you’d like to read more about interviewing at Flipdish, please check out our Interviewing at Flipdish guide.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;About Flipdish&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;At Flipdish, we’re turning the tables in favour of independent restaurant and takeaway owners by offering them powerful, simple-to-use tech solutions backed by real human support. Everything we do is designed to make running a restaurant satisfyingly simple in a world that’s anything but.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;You’ll join Flipdish’s Marketing team as a hands-on Performance Marketing Manager, owning the day-to-day execution and optimisation of paid acquisition campaigns across the UK and Ireland.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;This is an individual-contributor role for someone who enjoys being in the platforms, testing ideas and turning results into practical improvements. Meta will be your primary channel, with Google and ChatGPT as secondary channels. You’ll inherit an established Meta programme with a five-figure monthly media budget, with a clear mandate to protect what’s working while improving acquisition efficiency and lead quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;You’ll work closely with the VP of Marketing, who owns the wider growth strategy and approves channel priorities and major investment decisions. You’ll have autonomy to make day-to-day decisions within agreed budgets and priorities, alongside the opportunity to recommend new growth channels and run agreed experiments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;You’ll collaborate with colleagues across Commercial, Product, SEO/AEO, Social Media, Design and Videography, and PR and Brand. Our SEO/AEO specialist owns organic search and answer-engine optimisation; your focus will be making paid acquisition work effectively alongside that activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;Success means attracting suitable restaurant and takeaway operators and turning demand into qualified pipeline and signed customers—not just clicks or cheap leads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;What you’ll own&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage and optimise paid acquisition:&lt;/strong&gt; Own day-to-day execution across the established Meta programme and the Google paid suite, and continue early-stage ChatGPT testing. Manage campaign setup, audiences, budget pacing, tracking checks and campaign hygiene, seeking approval for material investment changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run disciplined experiments:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a prioritised testing programme across creative, messaging, audiences, bidding and landing-page conversion. Define clear hypotheses and success measures, interpret results honestly, scale promising approaches and stop tests that do not deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Explore new growth channels:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively bring the VP of Marketing practical recommendations supported by a clear rationale, test plan, proposed budget and success measures, then take ownership of agreed experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect campaign performance to commercial outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Marketing, Commercial and Product colleagues to understand lead quality, pipeline progression and customer acquisition. Use CPL, cost per qualified lead, conversion rates and CAC where reliable data is available, maintain established dashboards and help resolve tracking or reporting gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop effective creative and messaging:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate customer insights and product benefits into briefs, ad hooks and copy, coordinating asset production and iteration with Design and Videography. Use AI and SaaS tools to accelerate research, routine work and creative variations while applying your own judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across teams:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with our SEO/AEO specialist on messaging, landing pages and search insights, with organic strategy and execution remaining with that specialist. Communicate results, priorities, blockers and recommended next steps clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenge poor decisions and propose better ways of working.&lt;/strong&gt; Constructive challenge is a responsibility — prioritising harmony over truth or progress is a failure of responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;What success looks like&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The established Meta programme maintains or improves acquisition efficiency while generating suitable leads and signed customers across the UK and Ireland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead quality and funnel conversion improve, with campaign decisions guided by qualified pipeline and customer acquisition outcomes rather than clicks or low-cost leads alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A focused testing programme produces clear learning, identifies approaches worth scaling and stops ineffective activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Campaign messaging and creative reflect customer needs and product benefits, supported by effective collaboration across Marketing, Commercial and Product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance reporting clearly explains results, measurement gaps and recommended actions, supporting timely channel and investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;About you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;You’ll thrive in this role if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have &lt;strong&gt;5+ years’ experience in paid media or performance marketing&lt;/strong&gt;, with evidence of hands-on campaign ownership and measurable results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring &lt;strong&gt;strong Meta expertise&lt;/strong&gt; at meaningful spend levels and are comfortable working directly in the account or through supporting AI tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an &lt;strong&gt;essential paid media portfolio&lt;/strong&gt; showcasing campaigns you personally worked on, the work you’re proudest of and your strongest commercial returns. You can explain your contribution, testing approach and results, and showcase current live Meta ads through the Meta Ads Library.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have hands-on experience using the &lt;strong&gt;Google paid suite&lt;/strong&gt; to generate demand and acquire customers, with the ability to recommend, test and optimise campaigns against lead quality and commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand &lt;strong&gt;UK or Irish audiences&lt;/strong&gt; and can adapt messaging to their commercial and cultural context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring sound &lt;strong&gt;commercial judgement&lt;/strong&gt;, understanding lead quality, pipeline conversion and customer acquisition economics—and why a lower CPL does not always mean a better result.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are curious and proactive about &lt;strong&gt;new growth opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;, turning ideas into practical, prioritised experiments with clear success measures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are confident using &lt;strong&gt;dashboards and platform data&lt;/strong&gt; to diagnose performance, interpret results and recommend what should change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can write effective &lt;strong&gt;creative briefs and ad copy&lt;/strong&gt;, collaborate constructively with designers and work alongside an SEO/AEO specialist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of reliable execution, communicate clearly and know when to act independently and when to escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The following would help you stand out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in B2B SaaS, restaurant technology or marketing to small business owners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CRM data and connecting paid campaigns to qualified pipeline and customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience improving landing-page conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical use of AI tools or automation to save time on reporting, monitoring or creative iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;What you get&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;We’re a growing startup and we understand that amazing incentives will attract amazing talent. Alongside a competitive salary, we offer unparalleled opportunities for career growth. If you’re smart, ambitious, and hard-working, we’ll do whatever it takes to make you a Flipdisher!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hub model (hybrid):&lt;/strong&gt; A healthy blend of hub and home working, with two days per week from our Sandyford office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time off:&lt;/strong&gt; 25 days’ annual leave, plus public holidays and company days, such as seasonal Summer Fridays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private healthcare:&lt;/strong&gt; Irish cover provided through Laya Healthcare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pension:&lt;/strong&gt; Retirement savings support in Ireland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team connection:&lt;/strong&gt; Regular team meet-ups and company events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commuter supports:&lt;/strong&gt; TaxSaver / travel schemes, where available.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;Interview process&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;Here’s what you can expect throughout the interview process:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiter screening call — 15–30 minutes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring manager interview — 45–60 minutes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competency / technical stage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reference checks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;What to share before and during interviews&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;A paid media portfolio is an essential part of our interview process. We want to see the work you’re proud of, the commercial impact you’ve delivered and how you’re testing today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before your interview:&lt;/strong&gt; Share your portfolio and Meta Ads Library links to the relevant brand or advertiser pages for campaigns you currently work on. We’ll review the live ads before meeting you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At your interview:&lt;/strong&gt; Walk us through the campaigns you’re most proud of and those that generated the strongest returns. Explain the objective, your personal contribution, the creative and targeting approach, budget context, results and the decisions that improved performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Show us your current testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Use live examples from the Meta Ads Library to explain the hypotheses behind your creative variations, what you’re learning and what you would test next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evidence the impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Support your examples with results you’re permitted to share, such as ROAS, CAC, qualified pipeline or customer acquisition outcomes, including the measurement period and how results were attributed. The Ads Library provides the public creative examples; performance and testing outcomes should be explained separately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;Our culture&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;At Flipdish, we’re on the side of independent restaurant and takeaway owners, running busy operations on tight margins with rising costs, staffing challenges, and an increasingly demanding customer base. Our job is to make their lives easier with technology that’s powerful, satisfyingly simple, and backed by real human support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;Our integrated ecosystem, spanning online ordering, marketing, loyalty, point of sale, menu optimisation, and operational automation, helps restaurants grow while staying in control. We’re an AI-first company, and we use it to help our customers get better outcomes, faster ordering, smarter marketing, and smoother operations, so owners and teams can spend more time on what matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;Inside the company, we value ownership and clarity, with a friendly, people-led culture behind it. We trust our people to help shape what kind of employer Flipdish is, not just follow a script. Transparency is huge for us: we listen to each other, and create the space for people to grow—with balance, not burnout. We’re focused on impact and team energy, not “being seen”. You’ll have meaningful scope, work closely with smart people across teams, and be trusted to make things better as Flipdish scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;If you’d like to read more about interviewing at Flipdish, please check out &lt;a class=&quot;x1heor9g x1hl2dhg xt0psk2 x1ypdohk&quot; href=&quot;https://www.flipdish.com/downloads/Flipdish-Interview-Guide-2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;our Interviewing at Flipdish guide&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;About Flipdish&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;At Flipdish, we’re turning the tables in favour of independent restaurant and takeaway owners by offering them powerful, simple-to-use tech solutions backed by real human support. Everything we do is designed to make running a restaurant satisfyingly simple in a world that’s anything but.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;You’ll join Flipdish’s Marketing team as a hands-on Performance Marketing Manager, owning the day-to-day execution and optimisation of paid acquisition campaigns across the UK and Ireland.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;This is an individual-contributor role for someone who enjoys being in the platforms, testing ideas and turning results into practical improvements. Meta will be your primary channel, with Google and ChatGPT as secondary channels. You’ll inherit an established Meta programme with a five-figure monthly media budget, with a clear mandate to protect what’s working while improving acquisition efficiency and lead quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;You’ll work closely with the VP of Marketing, who owns the wider growth strategy and approves channel priorities and major investment decisions. You’ll have autonomy to make day-to-day decisions within agreed budgets and priorities, alongside the opportunity to recommend new growth channels and run agreed experiments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;You’ll collaborate with colleagues across Commercial, Product, SEO/AEO, Social Media, Design and Videography, and PR and Brand. Our SEO/AEO specialist owns organic search and answer-engine optimisation; your focus will be making paid acquisition work effectively alongside that activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;Success means attracting suitable restaurant and takeaway operators and turning demand into qualified pipeline and signed customers—not just clicks or cheap leads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;What you’ll own&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage and optimise paid acquisition:&lt;/strong&gt; Own day-to-day execution across the established Meta programme and the Google paid suite, and continue early-stage ChatGPT testing. Manage campaign setup, audiences, budget pacing, tracking checks and campaign hygiene, seeking approval for material investment changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run disciplined experiments:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a prioritised testing programme across creative, messaging, audiences, bidding and landing-page conversion. Define clear hypotheses and success measures, interpret results honestly, scale promising approaches and stop tests that do not deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Explore new growth channels:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively bring the VP of Marketing practical recommendations supported by a clear rationale, test plan, proposed budget and success measures, then take ownership of agreed experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect campaign performance to commercial outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Marketing, Commercial and Product colleagues to understand lead quality, pipeline progression and customer acquisition. Use CPL, cost per qualified lead, conversion rates and CAC where reliable data is available, maintain established dashboards and help resolve tracking or reporting gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop effective creative and messaging:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate customer insights and product benefits into briefs, ad hooks and copy, coordinating asset production and iteration with Design and Videography. Use AI and SaaS tools to accelerate research, routine work and creative variations while applying your own judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across teams:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with our SEO/AEO specialist on messaging, landing pages and search insights, with organic strategy and execution remaining with that specialist. Communicate results, priorities, blockers and recommended next steps clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenge poor decisions and propose better ways of working.&lt;/strong&gt; Constructive challenge is a responsibility — prioritising harmony over truth or progress is a failure of responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;What success looks like&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The established Meta programme maintains or improves acquisition efficiency while generating suitable leads and signed customers across the UK and Ireland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead quality and funnel conversion improve, with campaign decisions guided by qualified pipeline and customer acquisition outcomes rather than clicks or low-cost leads alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A focused testing programme produces clear learning, identifies approaches worth scaling and stops ineffective activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Campaign messaging and creative reflect customer needs and product benefits, supported by effective collaboration across Marketing, Commercial and Product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance reporting clearly explains results, measurement gaps and recommended actions, supporting timely channel and investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;About you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;You’ll thrive in this role if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have &lt;strong&gt;5+ years’ experience in paid media or performance marketing&lt;/strong&gt;, with evidence of hands-on campaign ownership and measurable results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring &lt;strong&gt;strong Meta expertise&lt;/strong&gt; at meaningful spend levels and are comfortable working directly in the account or through supporting AI tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an &lt;strong&gt;essential paid media portfolio&lt;/strong&gt; showcasing campaigns you personally worked on, the work you’re proudest of and your strongest commercial returns. You can explain your contribution, testing approach and results, and showcase current live Meta ads through the Meta Ads Library.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have hands-on experience using the &lt;strong&gt;Google paid suite&lt;/strong&gt; to generate demand and acquire customers, with the ability to recommend, test and optimise campaigns against lead quality and commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand &lt;strong&gt;UK or Irish audiences&lt;/strong&gt; and can adapt messaging to their commercial and cultural context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring sound &lt;strong&gt;commercial judgement&lt;/strong&gt;, understanding lead quality, pipeline conversion and customer acquisition economics—and why a lower CPL does not always mean a better result.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are curious and proactive about &lt;strong&gt;new growth opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;, turning ideas into practical, prioritised experiments with clear success measures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are confident using &lt;strong&gt;dashboards and platform data&lt;/strong&gt; to diagnose performance, interpret results and recommend what should change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can write effective &lt;strong&gt;creative briefs and ad copy&lt;/strong&gt;, collaborate constructively with designers and work alongside an SEO/AEO specialist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of reliable execution, communicate clearly and know when to act independently and when to escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The following would help you stand out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in B2B SaaS, restaurant technology or marketing to small business owners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CRM data and connecting paid campaigns to qualified pipeline and customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience improving landing-page conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical use of AI tools or automation to save time on reporting, monitoring or creative iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;What you get&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak&quot;&gt;We’re a growing startup and we understand that amazing incentives will attract amazing talent. Alongside a competitive salary, we offer unparalleled opportunities for career growth. If you’re smart, ambitious, and hard-working, we’ll do whatever it takes to make you a Flipdisher!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hub model (hybrid):&lt;/strong&gt; A healthy blend of hub and home working, with two days per week from our London Bridge office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time off:&lt;/strong&gt; 25 days’ annual leave, plus public holidays and company days, such as seasonal Summer Fridays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private healthcare:&lt;/strong&gt; UK cover, including Vitality private health insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pension:&lt;/strong&gt; Retirement savings support in the UK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team connection:&lt;/strong&gt; Regular team meet-ups and company events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing extras:&lt;/strong&gt; Bike-to-work / wellness benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
